    "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math> M (in 500 mL solution)<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math> in 500 mL solution will be<br /><br /><math><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn></math><br /><br />M <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>450</mn><mtext>&nbsp;mL</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext>&nbsp;mL,&nbsp;1M</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math><br /><br />Now, we have to calculate <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> in original solution (450 mL)<br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>450</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.11</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>",
